                </div>
                <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mb-4">
                  Rental History That Travels With You
                </h3>
                <p
                  class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-md"
                >
                  Every on-time payment and successful lease completion adds to
                  your score. No more hunting down old landlord references—your
                  history is built-in and verified.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div
                class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-4 border-t border-outline-variant pt-8"
