            </div>
            <div
              class="absolute -bottom-10 -left-10 w-48 h-48 bg-primary/5 rounded-full blur-2xl"
            ></div>
          </div>
          <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
            <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary mb-6">
              Verified Profiles, Instant Trust
            </h2>
            <p
              class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-8 leading-relaxed"
            >
              Say goodbye to repetitive paperwork. Once your HomiFund profile is
              verified, you can apply to any property in our network instantly.
              Our bank-grade verification ensures landlords see you as a
              serious, low-risk tenant from second one.
            </p>
            <div class="space-y-6">
              <div class="flex gap-4">
                <div
