            </h2>
            <p
              class="font-body-lg text-body-lg mb-10 opacity-90 leading-relaxed"
            >
              Rent is likely your biggest monthly expense—make it work for you.
              By setting up Direct Debit through HomiFund, you never miss a
              payment and every dollar contributes to a bulletproof reputation.
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
              <div
                class="p-6 bg-white/10 rounded-xl border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined mb-4 text-[32px]"
                  >payments</span
                >
                <h4 class="font-label-md text-label-md mb-2">
                  Build Track Record
                </h4>
                <p class="font-body-md text-body-md opacity-80">
                  Automated reporting of consistent payments to build your
                  HomiScore.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div
                class="p-6 bg-white/10 rounded-xl border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm"
              >
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined mb-4 text-[32px]"
                  >security</span
                >
                <h4 class="font-label-md text-label-md mb-2">
                  Tenant Protection
                </h4>
                <p class="font-body-md text-body-md opacity-80">
                  Full audit trail of all payments to protect you against
