                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative">
            <div
              class="w-full h-[500px] bg-cover bg-center rounded-3xl shadow-2xl"
              data-alt="A clean and modern high-angle photograph of a workspace with a smartphone displaying a sleek financial application interface. Next to the phone is a cup of coffee and a minimalist notebook, all set on a light oak wooden desk. The scene is bathed in natural daylight, creating a serene and professional atmosphere that emphasizes modern, effortless financial management."
              style="
                background-image: url(&quot;https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBby5SM700y9VNMwKZcAasCknVPvWgDS-gF1HwjxA8vUpnbjcHcjgJWNbynD5oND1r0Munma56gvK7PyOEAytDmTr8PzVCqZhg5YtOA3jq9sk_59JPyrrltKdktngR9tI0XsbhgTKCjRdXv6OH6OqRVedWYnbcSO_1e-55UUBl_TA6MI02i63UFZL4ZoOC7XMkYUPn_2djIsLVT7e-pGHEdEB0TsT9hIgUmfw-NPwaa1JQOC8_3k5mAw6UlGBRSKkaqf20QJmoRmCcL&quot;);
              "
            ></div>
            <div
              class="absolute -bottom-8 -right-8 p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-outline-variant text-on-surface max-w-[240px]"
            >
              <p
                class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-2"
              >
                Recent Achievement
              </p>
              <p class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold">
                12-Month Payment Streak!
              </p>
              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-1">
                +45 Points to HomiScore
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <!-- FAQ Section -->
      <section class="py-24 px-margin-desktop bg-surface">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          <h2
            class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary text-center mb-12"
          >
            Renter Frequently Asked Questions
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <details
              class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-outline-variant cursor-pointer hover:border-primary transition-colors"
            >
              <summary
                class="flex justify-between items-center list-none font-label-md text-label-md text-primary"
              >
                Is my data safe with HomiFund?
                <span
                  class="material-symbols-outlined group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform"
                  >expand_more</span
                >
              </summary>
              <p class="mt-4 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
                We use AES-256 bank-grade encryption to store your data. We
                never sell your personal information, and you have complete
                control over which landlords can view your verified profile and
                documents.
              </p>
            </details>
            <details
              class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-outline-variant cursor-pointer hover:border-primary transition-colors"
            >
              <summary
                class="flex justify-between items-center list-none font-label-md text-label-md text-primary"
              >
                Does HomiFund impact my credit score?
                <span
                  class="material-symbols-outlined group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform"
                  >expand_more</span
                >
              </summary>
              <p class="mt-4 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
                HomiFund creates its own internal 'HomiScore' specifically for
                the rental market. While we don't perform hard credit checks
                that impact your score, we are currently working with major
                bureaus to allow your rent payments to contribute positively to
                your official credit rating.
              </p>
            </details>
            <details
              class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-outline-variant cursor-pointer hover:border-primary transition-colors"
            >
              <summary
                class="flex justify-between items-center list-none font-label-md text-label-md text-primary"
              >
                How do I get my landlord to join HomiFund?
                <span
                  class="material-symbols-outlined group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform"
                  >expand_more</span
                >
              </summary>
              <p class="mt-4 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
                Once you create a profile, you can send an invite link directly
                to your landlord. Many landlords love it because it automates
                their collection and verification at no cost to them for basic
                plans.
              </p>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <!-- Final CTA -->
      <section class="py-24 px-margin-desktop relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary opacity-5"></div>
        <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto text-center relative z-10">
          <h2 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-primary mb-6">
            Your Next Home is Just <br />a Verified Profile Away.
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto"
          >
            Join thousands of tenants who are changing the way they rent. Better
            properties, faster approvals, and a reputation you own.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
            <button
              class="px-10 py-5 bg-primary text-on-primary rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all"
            >
              Start Building Your Reputation
            </button>
            <button
              class="px-10 py-5 bg-white text-primary border border-outline rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-all"
            >
              Contact Renter Support
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <!-- Footer -->
    <script>
      // Micro-interactions and effects
      document.querySelectorAll("details").forEach((el) => {
        el.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
          if (el.open) return;
          document.querySelectorAll("details").forEach((otherEl) => {
            if (otherEl !== el) otherEl.open = false;
          });
        });
      });

      // Simple scroll reveal for header
      let lastScroll = 0;
      window.addEventListener("scroll", () => {
        const currentScroll = window.pageYOffset;
        const header = document.querySelector("header");
        if (currentScroll > 100) {
          header.classList.add("shadow-md");
          header.style.transform =
            currentScroll > lastScroll ? "translateY(-100%)" : "translateY(0)";
        } else {
          header.classList.remove("shadow-md");
          header.style.transform = "translateY(0)";
        }
        lastScroll = currentScroll;
        header.style.transition = "transform 0.3s ease-in-out";
      });
    </script>

    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
